  "rationale": "The baseline uses GTDB only through --dada_ref_taxonomy (gtdb=R07-RS207). Switching it to the valid key silva=138, whose taxlevels end in Genus,Species and so work with addSpecies, re-runs DADA2 reference formatting, cutting and classification; the QIIME2/greengenes85 classifier is left unchanged. The DADA2 taxonomy is the one fed into QIIME2 downstream, so taxonomy filtering and every analysis built on the filtered table (exports, barplots, diversity, ANCOM-BC, R objects) re-run, along with the summary tables, Parquet output, MultiQC parameter summary and report."
